### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Get All Notifications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 3. Get Unread Count
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4. Mark Single Notification as Read
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications/YOUR_NOTIFICATION_ID/read
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 5. Mark Multiple Notifications as Read
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications/mark-read
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "notificationIds": ["NOTIFICATION_ID_1", "NOTIFICATION_ID_2"]
}

### 6. Mark All Notifications as Read
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN